>
  <section class="section wrap service-page__intro">
    <p class="type-label service-page__eyebrow">Services</p>
    <h1 class="type-display service-page__heading">Custom Drapery</h1>
    <p class="service-page__lead">
      Custom drapery for Cincinnati and Northern Kentucky homes, worked out in the room it belongs to.
      I pick the fabric with you, settle the details, sew the panels, and hang them myself.
